# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout for ALL platforms.
# Without this, Windows git (core.autocrlf=true on CI runners) checks out CRLF, which then fails
# `cargo fmt --check` (rustfmt newline_style = "Unix") and breaks cross-OS reproducibility.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly treat common binary types as binary (never normalize).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
